  "GamemodeDescriptions": {
    "<color=#c0c0c0ff>Learn the basics of how to play White Knuckle.</color>\n- <color=yellow>Basic Climbing</color>\n- <color=yellow>Momentum and Stamina</color>\n- <color=yellow>Core Item Usage</color>": "<color=#c0c0c0ff>Learn the basics of how to play White Knuckle.</color>\n- <color=yellow>Basic Climbing</color>\n- <color=yellow>Momentum and Stamina</color>\n- <color=yellow>Core Item Usage</color>[GM]",
    "Practice your technique in a safe environment.\n<color=yellow>- Race Mode\n<color=yellow>- Customizeable Difficulty\n<color=yellow>- Endless Climbing\n<color=red>Note: Some Achievements are blocked in this mode.</color>": "Practice your technique in a safe environment.\n<color=yellow>- Race Mode\n<color=yellow>- Customizeable Difficulty\n<color=yellow>- Endless Climbing\n<color=red>Note: Some Achievements are blocked in this mode.</color>[GM]",
    "<b>Welcome to the Advanced Course, Climber.</b>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>Think you're ready to explore the Substructure and beyond?</color>\n- <color=yellow>Race to the end</color> as fast as possible.": "<b>Welcome to the Advanced Course, Climber.</b>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>Think you're ready to explore the Substructure and beyond?</color>\n- <color=yellow>Race to the end</color> as fast as possible.[GM]",
    "<b>Deep In the Old Training Chambers</b>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>The Event left this sector damaged, but the Local Authority still thinks there's use in it yet.</color>\n- <color=yellow>Race to the end</color> as fast as possible.": "<b>Deep In the Old Training Chambers</b>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>The Event left this sector damaged, but the Local Authority still thinks there's use in it yet.</color>\n- <color=yellow>Race to the end</color> as fast as possible.[GM]",
    "<b>Resource Harvesting</b>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>Modified Lambda roaches are loose in the Drainage Sector.</color>\n- <color=yellow>Bank valuable roaches.</color>\n- <color=red>Avoid the Mass</color>, send it back down with every roach banked.\n- Bank roaches in the <color=yellow>Mass Damper</color> to lower the Mass even more.": "<b>Resource Harvesting</b>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>Modified Lambda roaches are loose in the Drainage Sector.</color>\n- <color=yellow>Bank valuable roaches.</color>\n- <color=red>Avoid the Mass</color>, send it back down with every roach banked.\n- Bank roaches in the <color=yellow>Mass Damper</color> to lower the Mass even more.[GM]",
    "<b>Communications are down</b>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>The Comms Array pier has locked up, and each dish requires a firmware update.</color>\n- Grab the <color=yellow>four disks</color>, and deliver them to each <color=yellow>Dish.</color>\n- Then, <color=yellow>return to the server room.": "<b>Communications are down</b>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>The Comms Array pier has locked up, and each dish requires a firmware update.</color>\n- Grab the <color=yellow>four disks</color>, and deliver them to each <color=yellow>Dish.</color>\n- Then, <color=yellow>return to the server room.[GM]",
    "<b>Experimental Artifact: The Shutter</b>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>Analysis and testing of a Δ-0004 projection has completed.</color>\n- <color=yellow>Use Items</color> to venture into the Extrapolated Dimension.\n- <color=yellow>Retrieve the Disk.</color>\n- Escape the Extrapolated Dimension, <color=red>DO NOT GET ERASED.": "<b>Experimental Artifact: The Shutter</b>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>Analysis and testing of a Δ-0004 projection has completed.</color>\n- <color=yellow>Use Items</color> to venture into the Extrapolated Dimension.\n- <color=yellow>Retrieve the Disk.</color>\n- Escape the Extrapolated Dimension, <color=red>DO NOT GET ERASED.[GM]",
    "<b>Welcome to the Boost Course, Climber.</b>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>Every reaction has an equal and opposite reaction.</color>\n- <color=yellow>Race to the top of the tower</color> as fast as possible.": "<b>Welcome to the Boost Course, Climber.</b>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>Every reaction has an equal and opposite reaction.</color>\n- <color=yellow>Race to the top of the tower</color> as fast as possible.[GM]",
    "<i>You are awake. It has felt like decades.</i>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>- Escape the SB10 Experimental Detention Facility</color>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>- Hide from threats, stay quiet.</color>": "<i>You are awake. It has felt like decades.</i>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>- Escape the SB10 Experimental Detention Facility</color>\n<color=#c0c0c0ff>- Hide from threats, stay quiet.</color>[GM]"
  },
